                    response: We extract fixed‐length                           
                    feature vectors from each lesion image                      
                    using a pretrained ResNet18 (with its                       
                    final classifier removed) and train a                       
                    simple logistic regression to predict                       
                    malignant vs. non‐malignant. We                             
